WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.167
Okay!

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:11.000
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:11.600
A.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:12.167
Nail,

00:00:12.167 --> 00:00:12.733
B.

00:00:12.733 --> 00:00:13.300
Hammer,

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:13.867
C.

00:00:13.867 --> 00:00:14.433
Saw,

00:00:14.433 --> 00:00:15.567
or D.

00:00:15.567 --> 00:00:16.133
Drill?

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:17.267
Five seconds!

00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:24.267
TIME'S UP!

00:00:24.933 --> 00:00:26.167
The answer is...

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:26.567
A,

00:00:26.567 --> 00:00:26.967
nail!

00:00:26.967 --> 00:00:27.767
A hammer,

00:00:27.767 --> 00:00:28.167
saw,

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:30.600
and drill are all tools you

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:31.033
use.

00:00:31.033 --> 00:00:33.467
A nail is what a tool

00:00:33.467 --> 00:00:34.267
works on,

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:36.300
so it does not belong.

00:00:37.433 --> 00:00:38.367
Here's one,

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:39.800
a picture puzzle!

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:42.167
Which shape completes the pattern?

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:42.633
A.

00:00:42.633 --> 00:00:44.033
A filled square,

00:00:44.033 --> 00:00:44.500
B.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:45.933
A filled circle,

00:00:45.933 --> 00:00:46.400
C.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:47.800
A filled triangle,

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:48.767
or D.

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:50.167
An empty triangle?

00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:51.100
Five seconds!

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:58.100
TIME'S UP!

00:00:58.767 --> 00:00:59.933
The answer is...

00:00:59.933 --> 00:01:00.300
C,

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:01.467
a filled triangle!

00:01:01.467 --> 00:01:03.767
The rule is the shape gets

00:01:03.767 --> 00:01:06.100
filled in but stays the same

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:06.467
shape,

00:01:06.467 --> 00:01:08.800
so the empty triangle becomes a

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:09.567
filled triangle.

00:01:10.733 --> 00:01:11.967
Here's one,

00:01:11.967 --> 00:01:13.800
a number series!

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:14.433
Two,

00:01:14.433 --> 00:01:15.033
five,

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:15.667
seven,

00:01:15.667 --> 00:01:16.267
twelve,

00:01:16.267 --> 00:01:16.900
nineteen,

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:18.133
and then...

00:01:18.133 --> 00:01:19.967
what comes next?

00:01:19.967 --> 00:01:20.567
A.

00:01:20.567 --> 00:01:21.200
Thirty-one,

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:21.800
B.

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:22.433
Twenty-six,

00:01:22.433 --> 00:01:23.033
C.

00:01:23.033 --> 00:01:23.667
Twenty-four,

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:24.900
or D.

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:25.500
Thirty-eight?

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:26.733
Five seconds!

00:01:32.533 --> 00:01:33.733
TIME'S UP!

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:35.600
The answer is...

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:36.000
A,

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:36.400
thirty-one!

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:38.800
Add the two numbers before it:

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:40.800
twelve plus nineteen is thirty-one.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:43.200
Each number is the sum of

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.800
the two before it.

00:01:45.967 --> 00:01:46.367
So,

00:01:46.367 --> 00:01:48.400
are you smart or fart?

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:50.833
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:50.833 --> 00:01:52.033
find your rank!

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:53.533
So,

00:01:53.533 --> 00:01:54.933
how did you do?

00:01:54.933 --> 00:01:56.300
Comment your score below,

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:57.667
and follow for more!
